                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.1+ACT.14.2+ACT.14.3+ACT.14.4+ACT.14.5+ACT.14.6+ACT.14.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 14:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.8+ACT.14.9+ACT.14.10+ACT.14.11+ACT.14.12+ACT.14.13+ACT.14.14+ACT.14.15+ACT.14.16+ACT.14.17+ACT.14.18+ACT.14.19+ACT.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 14:8-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lweny pa ji kodan kodi candirok paran. Iŋeyo gigipiny me je m'otimere ran i Antiok, Ikoniam kodi Listira. Je jobedo lweny mager m'aciro to Rwoth bothan kwoŋ je no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iy'adieri dhano je ma mito bedo gi kwo i Kristo Yesu, ji bino lwenyo gine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ji mareco kodi ma jor'aporapora jobino medirok gi reco, munyo jowondo jowoti gin kareno iwondo jo bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To in, medere iy'adieri m'ofonjin aka iyeyo m'icwiny'iye. Kole iŋeyo joma jofonjin adieri no, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gi paka wok i thino oyido iŋeyo Ndiko Maleŋ, manyalo miyin rieko ma limo both kwoŋ yeyo Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ndiko je Were am'omiyo meni, aka konyo swa ma fonjo adieri, kipusa komo, tiro podho, gi fonjo bedo gi kwo m'otire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋey nyaka dhano ma tiyo ri Were wobedi ŋat'ocowere maber, ma nigi gigipiny ma timo tic mabeyo ma nger je.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
